AXIS Reference Implementations

Instances included:
- AXIS-512
- AXIS-768
- AXIS-1024

Each instance directory contains:
- CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.h/.c: ICCS API wrapper for that digest length.
- axis_core.h/.c: ISO C AXIS reference implementation.
- axis_zero32_expr_word_generated.h: generated 32-beat zero-message update
  equations used by axis_core.c.
- def.h: AXIS constants from AXIS-Algorithm Description.pdf.
- drng.h/.c: ICCS deterministic random generator support code.
- KAT_CryptHash.c: ICCS KAT generation driver.
- Makefile: included build script for environments with make.
- README: instance-specific notes.

The reference implementation is intended for correctness auditing. It preserves
the ICCS CryptHash interface and follows the bit-indexing convention described
in AXIS-Algorithm Description.pdf. The optimized portable, AVX2, and
best-available builds live under Optimized_Implementation.
